{"id":"623033","name":"素臊子烩麻食","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/623033/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"黄花菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小油菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猫耳朵","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"配菜。","img":"images/623033/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"油热后下入豆腐块。","img":"images/623033/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盐、十三香。","img":"images/623033/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炸至金黄捞出备用。","img":"images/623033/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"重新起油，放入葱姜蒜。","img":"images/623033/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入西红柿丁大火翻炒。","img":"images/623033/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入香菇丁。","img":"images/623033/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"依次放入盐、十三香、酱油、蚝油。","img":"images/623033/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火炖炒3分钟。","img":"images/623033/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入黄花菜。","img":"images/623033/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/623033/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入适量清水。","img":"images/623033/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"水开后放入提前炸好的豆腐。","img":"images/623033/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入猫耳朵。","img":"images/623033/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大火炖5分钟。","img":"images/623033/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"淋入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/623033/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入小油菜。","img":"images/623033/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"最后放入味精、鸡精、胡椒粉。","img":"images/623033/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"搅匀即可出锅。","img":"images/623033/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"喜欢吃辣的，再配上油泼辣子，美太太！","img":"images/623033/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"豆腐一定提前炸好，这样更劲道入味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}